{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/304838-demon-forms-question","id":304838,"title":"Demon Forms Question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-06T12:04:28-08:00","id":304838,"title":"Demon Forms Question","content":"So the main rule book (in a place I can't find atm) and the Seattle book both reference having places Demons can relax in Demon form. Mortals are not allowed in such areas. This makes sense to me.<br /> <br /> But going Demon form, be it in front of the postman or by yourself, is a -3 Compermise, and as far as I can tell it does not matter who is around it is still a compromise. Humans add an additional -2 to the roll, unless drunk, when they add a +1.<br /> <br /> So I guess my question is:<br /> <br /> Does going Demon form in &quot;safe places&quot; still call for a Compromise with a full -3 (rules seem to suggest yes)<br /> Do drunk or high people make it less Compromising even than no humans at all? (rules seem to suggest yes)<br /> Have any of you made HRs to make it less Compromising if the Demon is alone or just with other Demons?<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/mai