 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-06T16:59:30-08:00","id":305111,"title":"","content":"I think the intention is that the +1 bonus for &quot;witnesses were intoxicated&quot; is added to the -2 penalty for witnesses noticing the Demon use an overt supernatural power (net -1 penalty). Otherwise, as you point out, drunk people make the transformation less compromising than if there were no witnesses, which seems unlikely to be the intent. Then again, that is kind of how the Context Matters Exploit works, so maybe?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3755-jaerys","name":"Jaerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}